terest  on debt which is great  uh no problem at all so for the little  understanding that i have  on islam with the rich  understanding that i have on property  i'll answer the question best i  can and that would be number one  you don't need to buy buy to that  properties to be a  property entrepreneur or whatever like  there's a lot of strategies  where you don't need to do that like  deal sourcing and rent and rents and  stuff  however and also there are investors  that you can go in together with on  joint ventures so you could  find a cash rich investor and go into  business with them you're not borrowing  from them  they're putting the money down you're  finding the deal and doing all the work  and then you're taking a profit share on  any future profits  uh there are lenders that will lend  i don't know exactly how it works but i  know that there are islam banks  so i'll probably get i'll probably get  one of my students because i've got many  who are muslim that have a real rich  understanding on both property and  um the the laws or maybe we could have a  conversation and discuss what happened  if that would be helpful so that's it  now  it's a wrap i hope you found this um  little q a session really helpful  i really look forward to hearing your  questions that you've got for me next  week if you haven't asked a question yet  do it right now don't forget to  subscribe hit the like button  and i'll see you guys next time thanks

